Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I said "Fa-aa-aw-ow…"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只因为女生胖   就跟她分手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You broke up with a girl because she was fat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.65,0:06:47.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.61,0:06:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那真的是很久以前的事了   她还在难过吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But it was a really, really long time ago. Does she still feel bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.16,0:06:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, apparently she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.70,0:06:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有句俗话说  "大象永远都不会忘记"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what they say, "Elephants never forget."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.83,0:07:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  要嫁给我  祝你好运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Seriously, good luck marrying me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.59,0:07:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  发生了什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比会是摩妮卡的伴娘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe is gonna be Monica's maid of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.26,0:07:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望这次会比上次  你帮楼下那个女孩当伴娘顺利  记得吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Well I hope it goes better than the last time you did it for that girl downstairs, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.89,0:07:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以前当过伴娘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have been maid of honor before?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.73,0:07:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看吧  那就是人不能说谎的原因\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You see? This is exactly why you shouldn't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.36,0:07:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了   我是伴娘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right that's it. I am maid of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.61,0:07:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不   我才是  为什么是你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I am. How come you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.95,0:07:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我在乎到不惜说谎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I cared enough to lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.99,0:07:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以帮你们决定   该由谁来当伴娘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey-hey-hey-hey, I could help you decide who should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该办个甄试会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We could have like uh, like an audition
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.79,0:07:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看你们当伴娘时   遇到突发事件会怎么处理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and see how you'd handle maid-of-honor-type situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.87,0:07:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么意思   当我需要一份工作时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you talking about? Like when I want a job...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.25,0:07:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会去试镜   如果他们觉得我是最棒的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I go to an audition and if I'm the best of the people they see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.46,0:07:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就可以演出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...they give me the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.26,0:07:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  甄试完毕后  谁来决定伴娘人选\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so after this audition, who decides who gets it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.88,0:07:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟罗斯可以当评审\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, me and Ross can be the judges.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这要比让我们自己来决定好   这太疯狂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's better than us deciding. Oh, come on! this is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.39,0:08:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能丢铜板决定吗   不   铜板恨我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can't we just flip a coin? No, coins hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.89,0:08:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你知道吗  我们让罗斯跟乔伊来决定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Okay fine, You know what? We will let Ross and Joey decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.73,0:08:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.27,0:08:09.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  甜心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.74,0:08:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  大帅哥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey there, you handsome thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种古龙水的确跟亚曼尼的一样棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, this cologne really is every bit as good as Giorgio.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把录影带拿来还你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just brought back your videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  听着  我想我们需要谈谈之前的事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Ross. Look, I think we need to talk about before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  千万别提那件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们非谈不可\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.77,0:08:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  听我说  那是我睡得最香甜的一觉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, look. That was the best nap I ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.57,0:08:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.07,0:08:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少来了  承认吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.91,0:08:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你睡过最香甜的一觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was the best nap you ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.03,0:08:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有过更棒的经验\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've had better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.41,0:09:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  什么时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. When?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  好吧  那是我睡过最香甜的一觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right! All right! It was the best nap ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我承认  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah! I said it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.84,0:09:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那都已经过去了  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But it's over, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.84,0:09:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想再来一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.47,0:09:21.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能再来一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We can't do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么   因为那样子太奇怪了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why not? Because it's weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.69,0:09:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.36,0:09:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想喝点东西吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want something to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.61,0:09:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  你有什么  温牛奶跟抗组胺药(帮助睡眠的)\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. What do you got? Warm milk and Excedrin PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.20,0:09:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.58,0:09:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚才知道你是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler! I just figured out who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我在做什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you figure out what I'm doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.54,0:09:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是路易斯波森   谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're Louis Posen. Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.25,0:09:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路易斯波森   他是我五年级时最好的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Lewis Posin!  He was my best friend in fifth grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一天我要他当我男朋友   他拒绝了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and-and then one day, I asked him to be my boyfriend and he said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.64,0:09:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道为什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.14,0:10:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他上厕所时  你一直在跟他说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because you kept talking to him while he was trying to go to the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不   因为他觉得我太\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, but because he thought I was too faaaaa...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.94,0:10:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每次想到这件事   我还是会觉得很难过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And every time I think about it, I feel as bad as I did in fifth grade!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.57,0:10:16.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的觉得你该跟茱丽道歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, I-I really think you should apologize to Julie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.53,0:10:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甜心  你在开玩笑吗  那是十六年前的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey, are you kidding? That was like 16 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果路易斯能跟我道歉  我会觉得好过一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I know. But y'know what? It would make me feel better if Louis apologized to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.83,0:10:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我会跟她道歉  但我可警告你  这可能会让我变成更棒的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'll do it. But I warn you, this may make me a better person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.46,0:10:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那不是你爱上的那个男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that is not the man you fell in love with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们会假设突发状况\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, all right, this is how it's gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.05,0:10:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来考验你们当伴娘的资格\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll give you hypothetical maid-of-honor situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.80,0:10:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,计分范围从1分到10分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and you will be scored on a scale of one to 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.26,0:10:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1分是最高分  不  10分才是最高分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One being the highest. No, Ten is the highest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.89,0:10:44.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么10分是最高分   因为它是最大的数字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why is 10 the highest? Because it's the highest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.52,0:10:50.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了   瑞秋   你先来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Rachel, you're up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1号突发状况   你跟摩妮卡在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Situation number one: You're with Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.57,0:10:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,婚礼就要开始了  摩妮卡想临阵脱逃  开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The wedding is about to start when Monica gets cold feet. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.94,0:11:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想嫁给钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't want to marry Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想临阵脱逃  没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've got cold feet. It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.82,0:11:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟一个男人共度一生   我不知道我是否办得到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, One man the rest of my life? I don't know if I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这表示我永远都不能跟乔伊上床了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This means I'll never get to sleep with Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.46,0:11:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, Monica...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.83,0:11:14.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,临阵脱逃是常见的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...getting cold feet is very common.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.88,0:11:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为你期待过高\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, It's just because of all the anticipation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.71,0:11:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只要记住你爱钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you just have to remember that you love Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.09,0:11:24.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也逃过婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And also, I ran out on a wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.85,0:11:27.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,逃婚的人得退还礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't get to keep the gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  你引述亲身经验\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Very good, drawing on your own experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错   很好   瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, very nice, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.65,0:11:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢评审\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you, judges.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.11,0:11:38.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马屁精  喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh, what a kiss ass. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.86,0:11:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  菲比  是的  大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Phoebe. Yes, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.28,0:11:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,婚礼进行到一半\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're now in the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.33,0:11:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡正要说 "我愿意" 的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica is about to say, "I do"...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她叔叔喝得烂醉   开始乱说乱叫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...when her drunk uncle starts yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会怎么做  开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you do? Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.75,0:11:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡还小的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When Monica was a little girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.58,0:11:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I remember that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.34,0:12:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好痛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.01,0:12:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常好  喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Very good! Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.18,0:12:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了  我给你满分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, excellent. Perfect score.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等   她破坏了正在进行中的婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute! She just made a scene in the middle of the ceremony!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.93,0:12:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   你想尝尝菲比的厉害吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Do you want a little taste of Pheebs?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.56,0:12:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你们得以伴娘的身分  说出对新人的贺词\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It is time for you to give your maid-of-honor speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.36,0:12:18.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  我们还没有准备\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ohh, wait a minute, We haven't even prepared--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.07,0:12:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始   好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go! Okay, okay, okay. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.82,0:12:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韦伯斯特大字典   对婚姻的定义是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Umm, Webster's Dictionary defines marriage as--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  不  忘了它  那段贺词太烂了  别在意  忘了它吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, no! Forget that! That sucks! Okay, never mind. Forget it. Urn, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.91,0:12:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我遇见我认识的摩妮卡时   她还只是六岁大的小女孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I met-I met Monica when we were just a couple of 6-year-olds...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.13,0:12:40.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德25岁时  我们成了朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and became friends with Chandler when he was 25...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.34,0:12:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然他看起来  很像六岁大的孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...although he seemed like a 6-year-old.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.30,0:12:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. That’s nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.55,0:12:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢   感激不尽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. Thank you very much. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.72,0:12:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看过他们单身  跟交往时的样子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've known them separately and I've known them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.39,0:12:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道他们交往时   深爱着彼此\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and-and to know them as a couple is to know that you are truly in the presence of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.19,0:13:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我想举杯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I would like to raise my glass...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.65,0:13:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,敬摩妮卡跟钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...to Monica and Chandler...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.45,0:13:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有他们要携手共度的  美好冒险历程\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and the beautiful adventure they are about to embark upon together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.24,0:13:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为他们做好了万全的准备  要展开这段旅程\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can think of no two people better prepared for the journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.79,0:13:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.71,0:13:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说的好  没错  真的很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great speech. Yeah, it really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.13,0:13:19.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.42,0:13:24.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  菲比  下一个是你  虽然我觉得那么做是多余的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Phoebe, I guess you're next. Although I really don't see the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.72,0:13:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信摩妮卡跟钱德要结婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe that Monica and Chandler are getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.73,0:13:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还记得  我跟瑞秋谈过这一天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I remember talking about this day with Rachel...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.44,0:13:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那时我们一起冲澡  全身一丝不挂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...while we were showering together, naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.95,0:13:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就算她后来居上了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And she's back in the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,茱丽   嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Julie. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.09,0:14:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是钱德宾   我猜你还记得我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler Bing. I guess you remember me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.55,0:14:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  备胎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello, Skidmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.47,0:14:11.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的绰号  待会再跟你解释\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a nickname. I'll explain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.30,0:14:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看得出原因\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's pretty clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.64,0:14:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很早以前就该跟你道歉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I owe you a long-overdue apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不该只因为你很胖  就跟你分手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I shouldn't have broken up with you because you were overweight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.69,0:14:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你跟我分手的原因\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's why you broke up with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You didn't know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来我的任务已经达成\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I guess my work here is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.66,0:14:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.08,0:14:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但首先我要说  你们两个都表现的很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, well first of all, I would like to say you both performed very well,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.75,0:14:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  你们应该觉得骄傲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}okay? You should be proud of yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.01,0:14:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还想说在这场比赛里  没有人是输家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I'd also like to say, that in this competition, there are no losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.93,0:14:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋除外  该死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, except Rachel. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.93,0:14:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗   我赢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? I won?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:15:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么   对不起   瑞秋   分数真的很接近\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? I'm sorry, Rash, it was, it was really close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.94,0:15:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我要求重新计分   事实上也没有那么接近\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, then I demand a recount! Actually, it wasn't that close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.86,0:15:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗   不  不  反正你们的方法太愚蠢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! You know what? No! No! Your thing was so stupid anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.11,0:15:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来丢铜板决定   好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}this was ridiculous, We're gonna flip a coin, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.99,0:15:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heads. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.24,0:15:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  铜板终于原谅我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? The coins have finally forgiven me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.04,0:15:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  我希望摩妮卡会原谅你   因为你会用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well You know what? I hope Monica forgives you after you throw her...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用怪力乱神的素食主义方式   对着她洒花片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...her vegetarian-voodoo-goddess-circle-y shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.46,0:15:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  没关系的  你们帅呆了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, it's gonna be okay. You guys are the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.26,0:15:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  我得告诉你  当评审真的把我累坏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Boy, I tell you. That judging stuff took a lot out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.18,0:15:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.56,0:15:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想或许我该上楼去   在我的沙发上好好睡一觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was thinking about maybe going upstairs and taking a little nap on my couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.03,0:15:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那关我什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why would I care about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不为什么   我只是说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No reason. I'm just saying that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.74,0:15:56.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会在那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that's where I'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.22,0:16:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然结局不如预期中理想   事实上我很满意自己的表现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}As bad as that went, I actually enjoyed myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.18,0:16:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我要为我做过的所有蠢事道歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think that I'm going to apologize for all the stupid things that I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.69,0:16:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不改掉做蠢事的习惯呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you just stop doing stupid things?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.48,0:16:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样子你就不必道歉了   我希望可以从两件事起做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then you wouldn't have to apologize. I'd love it if I could do both.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.57,0:16:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   我得问你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I have to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.95,0:16:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.29,0:16:42.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我变胖了  你会跟我分手吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you gonna break up with me if I get fat again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.87,0:16:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟茱丽分手  她变得有多胖呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you broke up with Julie Grath! How much weight could she have gained?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.75,0:16:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她胖了一百四十五磅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A hundred and forty-five pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在一年之内\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In one year?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.97,0:16:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  她吃了什么  她的家人吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My God, what did she eat? Her family?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:16:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是重点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.60,0:17:03.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道那样跟别人分手太蠢了  但当时我才十五岁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look I know it was a stupid reason to break up with someone, but I was 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.77,0:17:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  不只15岁的男孩觉得肥胖是个问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, well, that's not the only time this was an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:12.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得  你跟我们一起过感恩节的事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You remember when you spent Thanksgiving with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.69,0:17:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你骂我胖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You called me fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.03,0:17:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Okay, now wait a minute
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.36,0:17:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那完全是另一回事   怎么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was totally different. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.28,0:17:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不该听到那句话  我是在你背后偷偷说的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You were not supposed to hear that. I said that behind your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.46,0:17:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我怀孕了呢   我会变得跟现在不一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What if I have babies, okay? I'm gonna look different.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.13,0:17:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以接受那样的事   但我不相信你能做到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm okay with that, but I'm not sure you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.79,0:17:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得了解我不认为   你是个苗条的大美女\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look you have to realize I don't think of you as a thin, beautiful woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.84,0:17:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我待会儿就会为这种事道歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is one of the things that I can apologize for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.97,0:17:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说你是摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What I mean is, you're Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.60,0:17:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我吗   我爱上的人是摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? And I am in love with Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.65,0:17:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不论你变胖或是变瘦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you can balloon up or you can shrink down...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.03,0:17:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是会爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I will still love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.49,0:18:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即使我缩小到只有两寸高\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Even if I shrink down to 2 inches tall?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.74,0:18:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我会把你放在我的口袋里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd carry you around in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.54,0:18:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,备胎还是对女人很有一套的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Skidmark still got a way with the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.67,0:18:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨   菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.93,0:18:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.59,0:18:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来跟你道歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just want to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.55,0:18:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很抱歉   我太孩子气了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm really sorry I was a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.14,0:18:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太可笑了  瑞秋  我们都曾经是小孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's ridiculous. Rachel, we were all babies once.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.31,0:18:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说今天的事  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you mean today. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.32,0:18:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  你知道吗  你应该赢的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, and you know, you deserve to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.24,0:18:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在想这件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And y'know I was thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.03,0:18:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你是摩妮卡的伴娘  那我就是你的伴娘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you're Monica's maid of honor, that means I get to be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.58,0:18:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.58,0:18:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡跟钱德订婚时  我收集了一些东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When Monica and Chandler got engaged, I put some stuff together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.29,0:18:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以防万一   那真的是太好了  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}y'know Just in case. Oh, that's so sweet. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.67,0:18:57.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道摩妮卡   很喜欢这本诗集\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here is a book of poetry that I know Monica loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.22,0:18:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊   这真是有趣   你看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God, this is funny. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:03.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是有一年万圣节   她打扮成新娘的照片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here's a picture from one Halloween when she dressed up as a bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.35,0:19:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她要我帮她拉婚纱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And look, She made me carry her train...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.35,0:19:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那真的很奇怪   因为我扮的是神力女超人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...which was weird because I was Wonder Woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.27,0:19:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔   这是我发现的小包包\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, and here's a little purse that I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.19,0:19:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想应该可以把婚戒放在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know I just thought that maybe they could hold the rings in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.23,0:19:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  还有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Something. And...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.11,0:19:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上好的手帕   因为很多人会在婚礼哭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...vintage handkerchiefs, you know, because people cry at weddings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.83,0:19:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得拿几条走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just gonna grab a couple of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.45,0:19:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是棒极了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This stuff is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.04,0:19:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都忘了我把它放在这里了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I forgot this was in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.84,0:19:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我留下来   要在自己婚礼上用的吊袜带\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This was the garter that I was saving for my wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.72,0:19:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望它能成为  被摩妮卡 "借走的东西"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I wanted it to be Monica's "something borrowed."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.01,0:19:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它还是蓝色的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And it's blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.31,0:19:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.27,0:19:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我认为你应该当摩妮卡的伴娘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know Rach, I think that you should be Monica's maid of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.82,0:19:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.32,0:20:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  因为我想这对你来说意义更重大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Because I think it means more to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.32,0:20:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但菲比  你赢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, Pheebs, honey, you earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.99,0:20:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系   我是说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's fine. I mean, this is something...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.20,0:20:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你从十四岁就想这么做了吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that you've been thinking about since you were, what, 14?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.29,0:20:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不   那时我才十岁   我发育的很早\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I was 10. I just developed early.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.00,0:20:17.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  怎么了  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, what's going on? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.93,0:20:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们决定由瑞秋来当你的伴娘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, we just decided Rachel is going to be your maid of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.64,0:20:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.97,0:20:31.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  太棒了  我们得开始计划了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wow. Okay, we really have to start planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.43,0:20:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有很多特别的好点子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have, I have really specific ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.90,0:20:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该一星期开四次会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We should probably get together like four times per week.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.23,0:20:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到我家来  我们得在上班前开会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can come over to my place, we'll get together before work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.82,0:20:43.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得如何   六点半   我家见   好兴奋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you say, 6:30, my place? So excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.08,0:20:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   你现在笑吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, okay. You laugh now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她就会是你的伴娘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but she's gonna be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.64,0:21:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我睡得好熟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.23,0:21:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  你在做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude, what the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.37,0:21:38.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.97,0:21:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,失陪了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me.
